# Production storage

Default path is `python prks_app.py --testing`. Do not write `data/` or a live `PRKS_STORAGE` tree unless the user gave run-real authorization.

Run-real authorizes normal application writes only. It does not authorize deleting PDFs, deleting, resetting, or replacing the production DB, or clearing production storage.

Those destructive actions need a separate explicit confirmation that names the action.
